    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Machina sapiens.</strong> Human-machine threshold beings - integrated, augmented, and existentially unstable. Machine-first, distinct from cyber-augmented humans. A Cyborg gains <strong>+1 Cognition</strong>, chooses one subtype adjustment (+1 Physique or +1 Reflex) and one damping (-1 Presence or -1 Resolve), and carries a <strong>Presence ceiling</strong> below the normal tier cap.</p><p>Cyborgs cannot use magic (Arcane Severance), heal only through tech (Tech-Only Recovery), and suffer System Crisis at 0 Stamina. They build with frame <strong>modules</strong> instead of the Chrome chapter.</p>",
